870" end="01:08.140">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.140" end="01:12.340"><span begin="01:08.140" end="01:08.590">That </span><span begin="01:08.590" end="01:09.760">way</span><span begin="01:09.760" end="01:10.030">, </span><span begin="01:10.030" end="01:12.340">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.180" end="01:16.690"><span begin="01:13.180" end="01:13.480">Could </span><span begin="01:13.480" end="01:13.810">you </span><span begin="01:13.810" end="01:14.290">show </span><span begin="01:14.290" end="01:14.770">me </span><span begin="01:14.770" end="01:16.240">dear</span><span begin="01:16.240" end="01:16.690">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.690" end="01:19.900"><span begin="01:16.690" end="01:17.560">Something </span><span begin="01:17.560" end="01:17.920">I'm </span><span begin="01:17.920" end="01:18.250">not </span><span begin="01:18.250" end="01:19.900">seeing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.930" end="01:26.950"><span begin="01:19.930" end="01:21.220">Something </span><span begin="01:21.220" end="01:23.140">infinitely </span><span begin="01:23.140" end="01:26.950">interesting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.220" end="01:30.760"><span begin="01:27.220" end="01:27.610">Could </span><span begin="01:27.610" end="01:27.910">you </span><span begin="01:27.910" end="01:28.450">show </span><span begin="01:28.450" end="01:28.900">me </span><span begin="01:28.900" end="01:30.310">dear</span><span begin="01:30.310" end="01:30.760">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.760" end="01:34.030"><span begin="01:30.760" end="01:31.660">Something </span><span begin="01:31.660" end="01:32.020">I'm </span><span begin="01:32.020" end="01:32.380">not </span><span begin="01:32.380" end="01:34.030">seeing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.060" end="01:38.590"><span begin="01:34.060" end="01:35.320">Something </span><span begin="01:35.320" end="01:37.240">infinitely </span><span begin="01:37.240" end="01:38.590">interesting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.460" end="01:55.870"><span begin="01:54.460" end="01:54.670">There's </span><span begin="01:54.670" end="01:55.270">something </span><span begin="01:55.270" end="01:55.870">about</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.870" end="01:57.700"><span begin="01:55.870" end="01:56.050">The </span><span begin="01:56.050" end="01:56.560">way </span><span begin="01:56.560" end="01:56.710">you </span><span begin="01:56.710" end="01:57.700">move</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.960" end="02:02.170"><span begin="01:58.960" end="01:59.260">I </span><span begin="01:59.260" end="01:59.590">see </span><span begin="01:59.590" end="01:59.770">your </span><span begin="01:59.770" end="02:00.520">mouth </span><span begin="02:00.520" end="02:00.640">in </span><span begin="02:00.640" end="02:01.330">slow </span><span begin="02:01.330" end="02:02.170">motion</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.170" end="02:04.720"><span begin="02:02.170" end="02:02.590">When </span><span begin="02:02.590" end="02:02.950">you </span><span begin="02:02.950" end="02:04.720">sing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.590" end="02:10.120"><span begin="02:08.590" end="02:08.800">More </span><span begin="02:08.800" end="02:09.280">subtle </span><span begin="02:09.280" end="02:09.460">than </span><span begin="02:09.460" end="02:10.120">something</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.120" end="02:11.980"><span begin="02:10.120" end="02:10.630">Someone </span><span begin="02:10.630" end="02:11.980">contrives</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.120" end="02:15.340"><span begin="02:13.120" end="02:13.480">Your </span><span begin="02:13.480" end="02:14.020">movements </span><span begin="02:14.020" end="02:14.830">echo </span><span begin="02:14.830" end="02:15.340">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.340" end="02:18.610"><span begin="02:15.340" end="02:15.640">I </span><span begin="02:15.640" end="02:15.790">have </span><span begin="02:15.790" end